    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "title": "① 这是无模型预检工作流",
      "pos": [
        0,
        120
      ],
      "size": [
        650,
        300
      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 6,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "## 不加载模型，也不采样\n\n点击运行后只执行Event→Plan→Resource Estimate→Preview。估算节点计算H3 packed行数和Relay显式bias，Preview检查哈希、24fps、`17n+5`、空档、重叠和每段至少5帧。全部Event关闭时显示BYPASS且bias为0。估算不含模型权重、完整attention、CLIP/VAE、VBAR或碎片，不能当成16GB安全证明。"
      ],
      "color": "#214d35",
      "bgcolor": "#12281d"
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "title": "② 修改与串联规则",
      "pos": [
        700,
        120
      ],
      "size": [
        650,
        300
      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 7,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "## 一个节点写一个局部动作\n\n复制Event，把上一项输出连到下一项`previous_events`，最后一项接Plan。`frames`的end包含端点；`seconds/percent`的end是边界；`auto_equal`会忽略start/end。全局人物、场景和声音只写在Plan的global_prompt。"
      ],
      "color": "#214d35",
      "bgcolor": "#12281d"
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "title": "③ READY之后再接模型",
      "pos": [
        1400,
        120
      ],
      "size": [
        650,
        300
      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 8,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "## 预检通过不等于画质通过\n\nResource Estimate的Plan输出继续进入Preview，再可接Query Route或Conditioning。资源数字只覆盖显式Relay bias；READY只证明时间线合同正确。二者都不证明Prompt Relay一定提质、音频不变或任意16GB组合安全。真正生成仍先用report_only，再显式切apply_exp。"
      ],
      "color": "#214d35",
      "bgcolor": "#12281d"
    }
